---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
import "../styles/shared-tool.css";
const title="割り勘・立替精算ツール｜誰が誰にいくら払うか自動計算";
const description="旅行・飲み会などの立替を共有URLで記録し、誰が誰にいくら払えば精算できるかを自動計算する無料の割り勘ツールです。";
const appJson={"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebApplication",name:"割り勘・立替精算ツール",url:siteConfig.url+"/split-bill/",applicationCategory:"FinanceApplication",operatingSystem:"Web",isAccessibleForFree:true,description};
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} ogImage="/og/share.png" ogImageAlt="割り勘・立替精算ツール｜無料Web便利ツール集">
  <div class="shell shared-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="パンくず"><a href="/">ホーム</a><span>/</span><a href="/category/share/">共有・調整</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">割り勘・立替精算</span></nav>
    <div class="shared-loading" data-loading><span class="shared-loader"></span><p>読み込み中...</p></div>

    <section data-create hidden>
      <header class="shared-heading"><p class="eyebrow">SPLIT BILL</p><h1>割り勘・立替精算</h1><p>みんなの支払いを共有して、最後に「誰が誰へいくら払うか」を自動計算します。</p></header>
      <div class="shared-card">
        <form data-create-form>
          <div class="shared-field"><label for="split-title">グループ名 <span>必須</span></label><input id="split-title" name="title" maxlength="100" required placeholder="例：北海道旅行" /></div>
          <div class="shared-field"><label for="split-description">メモ</label><textarea id="split-description" name="description" rows="3" maxlength="800" placeholder="旅行期間や補足など"></textarea></div>
          <div class="shared-field"><label for="split-members">参加者 <span>2人以上</span></label><textarea id="split-members" name="participants" rows="7" required placeholder="1行に1人ずつ入力&#10;田中&#10;鈴木&#10;佐藤"></textarea><small>最大20人。作成後の参加者変更はできません。</small></div>
          <div class="shared-storage"><strong>精算データを最大90日保存します</strong><p>参加者名・支払い金額・メモ・負担対象を共有のためCloudflare上に保存します。</p></div>
          <p class="shared-error" data-create-error hidden></p>
          <button class="button button-primary shared-submit" type="submit" data-create-button>割り勘を作成</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-event hidden>
      <div class="shared-created" data-created hidden><strong>割り勘を作成しました</strong><span>共有URLをメンバーへ送って、立替を追加してもらえます。</span></div>
      <header class="shared-heading"><p class="eyebrow">SPLIT BILL</p><h2 class="event-title" data-title></h2><p data-description hidden></p><div class="shared-meta"><span data-total>合計 0円</span><span data-expiry></span></div></header>
      <div class="shared-sharebox"><div><strong>共有URL</strong><span>URLを知っている人が支払いを追加できます</span></div><div class="shared-share-row"><input data-share-url readonly /><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-copy>URLをコピー</button></div><p class="shared-privacy">共有URLを知っている人には参加者名・金額・支払い内容が表示されます。</p><p class="shared-copy" data-copy-message hidden>コピーしました。</p></div>

      <section class="settlement-panel shared-card">
        <div class="shared-section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">SETTLEMENT</p><h2>精算するなら</h2></div></div>
        <div class="settlement-list" data-settlements></div><p class="shared-empty" data-settlement-empty>支払いを追加すると精算方法を表示します。</p>
      </section>

      <div class="shared-grid split-layout">
        <section class="shared-card">
          <div class="shared-section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPENSE</p><h2 data-expense-heading>支払いを追加</h2></div><button class="shared-text-button" type="button" data-cancel-edit hidden>編集をやめる</button></div>
          <form data-expense-form>
            <div class="shared-field"><label for="split-payer">支払った人 <span>必須</span></label><select id="split-payer" data-payer></select></div>
            <div class="shared-field"><label for="split-amount">金額 <span>必須</span></label><input id="split-amount" data-amount type="number" min="1" max="100000000" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="例：12000" /></div>
            <div class="shared-field"><label for="split-memo">内容</label><input id="split-memo" data-memo maxlength="120" placeholder="例：ホテル代" /></div>
            <div class="shared-field"><label>負担する人 <span>1人以上</span></label><div class="member-checks" data-members></div><button class="mini-action" type="button" data-all-members>全員を選択</button></div>
            <p class="shared-error" data-expense-error hidden></p>
            <div class="shared-actions"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit" data-expense-submit>支払いを追加</button><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-expense-delete hidden>この支払いを削除</button></div>
          </form>
        </section>

        <aside class="shared-card"><p class="eyebrow">BALANCE</p><h2 class="side-title">現在の差額</h2><div class="balance-list" data-balances></div></aside>
      </div>

      <section class="shared-card expense-section">
        <div class="shared-section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">HISTORY</p><h2>支払い履歴 <span data-expense-count>0</span></h2></div></div>
        <div class="expense-list" data-expenses></div><p class="shared-empty" data-expense-empty>まだ支払いはありません。</p>
      </section>

      <div class="shared-footer-actions"><a class="button button-secondary" href="/split-bill/">新しい割り勘を作る</a><button class="shared-danger" type="button" data-delete hidden>この割り勘を削除</button></div>
    </section>

    <section class="shared-not-found" data-not-found hidden><h2>割り勘データが見つかりません</h2><p>URLが違うか、保存期限を過ぎた可能性があります。</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/split-bill/">新しく作成する</a></section>

    <section class="shared-info"><div class="shared-info-block"><p class="eyebrow">HOW TO USE</p><h2>使い方</h2><div class="shared-howto"><div><strong>1. メンバー登録</strong><span>旅行や飲み会の参加者を登録。</span></div><div><strong>2. 立替を記録</strong><span>支払った人・金額・負担メンバーを入力。</span></div><div><strong>3. 精算</strong><span>誰が誰へいくら払うか自動計算。</span></div></div></div><div class="shared-info-block shared-faq"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>よくある質問</h2><details><summary>一部の人だけが負担する支払いにも対応しますか？</summary><p>はい。支払いごとに負担するメンバーを選択できます。</p></details><details><summary>端数はどうなりますか？</summary><p>各人の差額は1円単位に丸めて精算案を計算します。</p></details></div></section>
  </div>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(appJson)} />
  <script src="../scripts/split-bill.ts"></script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.shared-page [hidden]{display:none!important}.event-title{margin:5px 0 10px;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px)}.side-title{margin:3px 0 14px;font-size:21px}
.settlement-panel{margin-bottom:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fbff,#eef5ff)}.settlement-list{display:grid;gap:8px}.settlement-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:11px 13px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid #d7e3f4}.settlement-row strong{font-size:14px}.settlement-row span{color:var(--accent);font-weight:900;font-size:14px}
.member-checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.member-check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.member-check input{width:auto;height:auto}.mini-action{justify-self:start;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;padding:5px 0}
.balance-list{display:grid;gap:8px}.balance-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px}.balance-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}.balance-row strong.positive{color:#218543}.balance-row strong.negative{color:#b42318}.balance-row strong.zero{color:var(--muted)}
.expense-section{margin-top:16px}.expense-list{display:grid;gap:9px}.expense-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}.expense-item-main{min-width:0}.expense-item-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:7px}.expense-item-head strong{font-size:13px}.expense-item-head b{font-size:15px}.expense-item p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}.expense-edit{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.shared-section-title h2 span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:520px){.member-checks{grid-template-columns:1fr}.expense-item{grid-template-columns:1fr}.settlement-row{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}}
</style>